175	// respond before redir, the other relies on the default order. Neither the
176	// returned JSON, the warnings, nor the error of one call may reflect the
177	// other call's tree or directive order: this both detects data races (run
178	// under -race) and semantic cross-talk through process-wide state mutated
179	// while adapting.
